    {
      "msgid": "vehicle/A134_M24E2_SuperChaffee",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "A legendary light tank that features great maneuverability. The vehicle causes a decent amount of damage per minute and has good depression and elevation angles, which allows it to use terrain irregularities to its advantage in battle.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "vehicle/G158_VK2801_105_SPXXI",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "This vehicle is armed with a high-caliber gun and features nice armoring, although this affects its dynamics and maneuverability. The tank is somewhat clunky, which makes it extremely effective when ramming light-armored vehicles.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "vehicle/R160_T_50_2",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "A light tank that is perfect for active reconnaissance at all stages of battle. Its small silhouette and high speed allow it to avoid being hit, which is extremely important given its modest firepower.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "vehicle/R197_KV_1S_MZ",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "This is the only vehicle at its tier featuring an inverse autoreloader. It is at its best when causing burst damage to enemy vehicles or providing support fire to allies.",
